्ति f. stance qui est une पङ्क्ति quant au nombre\ndes syllabes des पादस्.\nअक्षरसन्स्थान n. assemblage des lettres, écriture.", "gloss_language": "fr"}], "synonyms": ["अक्षरं", "अक्षरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["akzaraM", "akzaraH"]}], "aksarya": [{"id": "akzarya", "headword": "अक्षर्य", "headword_slp1": "akzarya", "fold": "aksarya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षर्य अक्षर्य n. syllabe.", "gloss_language": "fr"}]}], "aksavati": [{"id": "akzavatI", "headword": "अक्षवती", "headword_slp1": "akzavatI", "fold": "aksavati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षवती अक्षवती f. (sfx. वत्) jeu des dés.", "gloss_language": "fr"}]}], "aksavawa": [{"id": "akzavAwa", "headword": "अक्षवाट", "headword_slp1": "akzavAwa", "fold": "aksavawa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षवाट अक्षवाट m. (वाट) arène, amphithéâtre\noù l'on se dispute un prix.", "gloss_language": "fr"}], "synonyms": ["अक्षवाटः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["akzavAwaH"]}], "aksavid": [{"id": "akzavid", "headword": "अक्षविद्", "headword_slp1": "akzavid", "fold": "aksavid", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षविद् अक्षविद् a. (विद्) qui connaît la procédure ou le\njeu.", "gloss_language": "fr"}]}], "aksanti": [{"id": "akzAnti", "headword": "अक्षान्ति", "headword_slp1": "akzAnti", "fold": "aksanti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षान्ति अक्षान्ति f. (क्षम्) impatience; intolérance; envie.", "gloss_language": "fr"}], "synonyms": ["अक्षांति", "अक्षांतिः", "अक्षान्तिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["akzAMti", "akzAMtiH", "akzAntiH"]}], "aksaralavaRa": [{"id": "akzAralavaRa", "headword": "अक्षारलवण", "headword_slp1": "akzAralavaRa", "fold": "aksaralavaRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "burnouf", "senses": [{"gloss": "अक्षारलवण अक्षारलवण m. certains aliments permis\npendant les jours de deuil.", "gloss_language": "fr"}], "synonyms": ["अक्षारलव